# Configuration definitions for thorn Cartoon2DX

REQUIRES CarpetX
REQUIRES Loop
REQUIRES Arith

# NOTE: This thorn has no INHERITS: of any kind (see interface.ccl).
# configuration.ccl REQUIRES is for build-time capabilities (Loop/Arith/
# CarpetX PROVIDE a capability matching their own name), not "make sure
# this other thorn is active".
